@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

title SecurBank - Collaboration Diagram (Communication)

object "<u>:ReactDashboard</u>" as UI
object "<u>:FlaskAPI</u>" as API
object "<u>:PredictionEngine</u>" as PE
object "<u>:DatabaseManager</u>" as DB

User -> UI : 1: Input details
UI -> API : 2: POST /predict
API -> API : 3: Verify Auth
API -> PE : 4: predict()
PE -> PE : 5: feature_eng()
API -> DB : 6: save_result()
API -> UI : 7: JSON response
UI -> User : 8: Render Rs results

@enduml
